              <lg xml:id="m-a6599c99-4386-404d-bc75-8858970822a1">
                <l xml:id="m-7bb6e9e1-7d66-4520-8767-716e089390fe" facs="#m-8a43557b-b124-4019-bf8d-50395bee0023" label="text-like">for Feasts which are not I. class.</l><l xml:id="m-2f8db1d2-d31b-4c8d-804f-cfc6ef59c363" facs="#m-3c7c5337-3add-4f73-b70e-66280d3787f4" label="ambiguous">270r</l><l xml:id="m-7c4c623f-555f-41a0-b2d3-98ee95e60ef8" facs="#m-d8438bbf-5eac-4777-9461-ec56565e6d7b" label="lyrics-like">In Paschal Time. Ant. Allelúia. p. 236.</l><l xml:id="m-2692487a-c9ab-4fe4-88dc-6cb1874d9378" facs="#m-996c7639-cbd1-41a1-910d-914861b60e11" label="lyrics-like">Ps. 39. I. Exspéctans exspectávi. NV. 1-11 with Glória. p. 1793.</l><l xml:id="m-d515127f-da62-431d-80f7-a8a7bbf282b3" facs="#m-299f70ec-c3b5-4569-b5c9-e9ade53281f6" label="lyrics-like">Ps. 39. H. Annuntiávi justítiam túam. YV. 12-18 with Glória.</l><l xml:id="m-9f3375c4-578e-427e-9569-7285225687d1" facs="#m-08a337c0-220d-4d2f-915e-21c93b6923a6" label="lyrics-like">Ps. 39. Hi. Confundántur et revereántur. VV. 19-24vith Glória.</l><l xml:id="m-c9d36933-ca0f-4b02-9cea-5f2f1268cf42" facs="#m-7dc27fe8-4099-435a-8fe2-ce77d6ad3b88" label="ambiguous">An¬</l><l xml:id="m-850157d6-a5d0-476c-8ac8-c9c79178410f" facs="#m-7996b362-a16d-49d6-ac82-5d767c7cae62" label="ambiguous">tiphon.</l><l xml:id="m-f0d3dae5-5a77-4e3f-bc6b-31fb0f0d084a" facs="#m-8c5be523-a812-45e6-9efa-f60b14e50edd" label="lyrics-like">Respéxit me,</l><l xml:id="m-93738c4e-b22a-4517-91d4-403371a10a19" facs="#m-97d9c365-71a2-4513-b3f3-12c405e0e002" label="lyrics-like">et exaudí-vit depreca-ti-ônem</l><l xml:id="m-f548a0f5-703d-4006-8449-88550d8d88a8" facs="#m-f7b1fb4d-5d86-4409-b2be-cccca4356cb0" label="lyrics-like">mé- am Dómi-nus.</l><l xml:id="m-0ad7aaf3-8cb6-453a-b0c4-c3365f8501c3" facs="#m-13441bf0-02df-4554-8f8d-75322ff81f21" label="lyrics-like">In Paschal Time. Ant. Allelúia, allelúia, allelúia. p. 239.</l><l xml:id="m-7dbfcd8c-3dee-4381-beed-c46796df334d" facs="#m-d63ea35e-d280-489e-8b80-e85a0e389447" label="text-like">TUESDAY AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-66c7a71d-3d1a-45fc-945d-fc0b34426e18" facs="#m-eec010ff-b63d-4cdf-a9d6-e2734ddb96be" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-a967fe6f-b6ba-4d30-8685-8590c79e14dd" facs="#m-10ac85c3-f3c4-44d2-b23f-3c98402fdcbd" label="ambiguous">8.G</l><l xml:id="m-18323439-5a14-4f54-ae61-00b9064a29ae" facs="#m-b222895f-f211-4f76-898c-b26344a2cb27" label="ambiguous">S</l><l xml:id="m-b3d0d535-d4c0-4092-acba-9c289198aa54" facs="#m-a7425ceb-4b88-4a7d-9de4-b8e16fb2ff6a" label="lyrics-like">Uscepíssti me, Dómine. Eu ou a e.</l><l xml:id="m-7a850b16-058c-405d-81aa-d69772f8166f" facs="#m-fbe4648d-e26e-4e23-a301-73d901f7af5c" label="lyrics-like">In Paschal Time. Ant. Allelúia. p. 241.</l><l xml:id="m-47e348e8-02ff-492f-906b-b0e77acdf633" facs="#m-deee1354-5b42-478b-9698-f5d11a10aaff" label="lyrics-like">Ps. 40. Beátus qui intélligit. YV. 1-14 with Glória. p. 1794.</l><l xml:id="m-68d35ed8-6f70-496f-896b-7268e0336633" facs="#m-ac1d40ae-f5dd-4d11-88aa-2b76ac0bfbdd" label="lyrics-like">Ps. 41. I. Quemádmodum desíderat. YV. 1-7 with Glória. p. 1795.</l><l xml:id="m-436890c6-e38b-48e7-8389-34fc7f09c719" facs="#m-c0143b10-38fa-4000-9e3e-cb8250188eed" label="lyrics-like">Ps. 41. H. Ad meípsum ánima méa. Yy. 8-16 with Glória.</l><l xml:id="m-d6436104-1103-4dcf-bab3-5c098b07938a" facs="#m-d5d38c03-2048-439e-8415-3f64a4cbfe7c" label="ambiguous">An¬</l><l xml:id="m-af331399-9026-46c0-9de5-ba9352eb93eb" facs="#m-13a1d3c2-997e-4c2d-b88c-70d38172f04b" label="ambiguous">tiphon.</l><l xml:id="m-3826c81b-d674-4fba-b489-5bba0c895a30" facs="#m-f032fd28-8567-4145-a1e9-46957c25b44b" label="lyrics-like">Suscepí-sti me, Dómi-ne, et confirmásti me in con¬</l><l xml:id="m-da4745f4-5d43-4396-8276-00492753a24b" facs="#m-15374a9f-16ba-4a73-91e2-f8467cf2342b" label="lyrics-like">spéctu tú¬o</l><l xml:id="m-54d00ed1-429a-4bb2-b25c-4841435002de" facs="#m-45976ffd-07be-4f10-96e0-32d11d0d7d44" label="lyrics-like">In Paschal Time. Ant. Allelúia, allelúia, allelúia. p. 244.</l><l xml:id="m-d2cd15d6-2436-460c-a1f6-cda86dbd8311" facs="#m-ea155906-b66f-47d8-848a-e519dffd9d35" label="text-like">TUESDAY AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-380c6c9f-ae02-49a5-93eb-b76cd5e3a4ff" facs="#m-f73902e3-9d06-4175-b891-20bd88df1d3c" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-84eabf3c-39c8-473a-8288-d32a714eea8e" facs="#m-e4fc310c-d579-449a-9bf9-13b5448291c3" label="ambiguous">2.b</l><l xml:id="m-8fc3f4bf-bf07-4e1d-ba63-9f17156edefe" facs="#m-e2abfb8b-f6ec-434e-a56b-2e9e0e9683b5" label="ambiguous">O</l><l xml:id="m-92610e07-fa44-4a80-946b-f9008ba40e97" facs="#m-5d1d55f6-4da8-4402-9a3a-781b0f0ee4d1" label="lyrics-like">Alvásti nos.</l><l xml:id="m-25c68f9b-a1da-46c7-885d-ee0ed9fd3a43" facs="#m-ce986e0a-2e14-4d49-ac55-8a3fc9c7cc03" label="ambiguous">Eu ou a e.</l></lg>
